WEEK 4 PROGRESS

SUPPORT VECTOR MACHINE (SVM) & MODEL OPTIMIZATION

    Preprocessed and scaled the Heart Disease dataset using StandardScaler
    Built and trained a Support Vector Machine (SVM) classification model
    Evaluated model performance using 5-Fold Cross Validation
    Compared accuracy scores across different validation folds
    Optimized the SVM model using GridSearchCV
    Tuned hyperparameters such as C, kernel, and gamma
    Evaluated the optimized model using Accuracy Score, Confusion Matrix, and Classification Report

MODEL SAVING & PREDICTION

    Saved the trained SVM model using Joblib
    Loaded the saved model without retraining
    Predicted heart disease for new patient data
    Understood the complete workflow of model saving, loading, and prediction

SKILLS GAINED

    Support Vector Machine (SVM)
    Feature Scaling using StandardScaler
    Cross Validation
    Hyperparameter Tuning using GridSearchCV
    Model Evaluation Techniques
    Confusion Matrix & Classification Report
    Model Saving & Loading with Joblib
    Machine Learning Model Deployment Basics

